        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "2 g Ce(NO3)3·6H2O and 9 g trimethylacetic acid (TMA) were added to 100 mL MeCN. After stirring for 60 min, 2 mL Ti(OiPr)4 was added, followed by stirring for another 20 min. The mixture was left in an 80 °C oven overnight. The powder was filtered out and the filtrate was kept at 80 °C for at least 2 days to obtain single crystals of Ce4Ti2-TMA. Crystals were washed with acetonitrile and dried in an 80 °C vacuum oven overnight. The main text notes that a more detailed cluster procedure is in the SI.",
